      en: ["Owned and operated by Lucara Diamond Corp", "Founding site of the 1,109-carat Lesedi La Rona", "First diamond mine to utilize XRT sorting technology", "Ore source is the high-value AK06 kimberlite pipe", "Underground expansion to extend mine life until 2040", "Home to the CLARA digital diamond sales platform"],
